by check mark if the registrant is not required to file reports pursuant to Section 13 or Section 15(d) of the Act. &#9744; Yes &#9746;
<span id="xdx_90A_edei--EntityVoluntaryFilers_c20250701__20260630_z2XOZsGhcDhb"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" id="Fact000036" name="dei:EntityVoluntaryFilers">No</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

