<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">USCF
Advisers, a registered investment adviser, is the investment adviser to the funds listed below each a separate series of the USCF ETF
Trust (&#8220;ETF Trust&#8221;) and has overall responsibility for the general management and administration of the ETF Trust. Pursuant
to investment advisory agreements, USCF Advisers provides an investment program for each series of the ETF Trust and manages the investment
