5. <span id="xdx_821_z34PjLAiec81">CERTAIN BALANCE SHEET DETAILS</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact000994" name="srt:ScheduleOfCondensedBalanceSheetTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_895_esrt--ScheduleOfCondensedBalanceSheetTableTextBlock_z4GOp4tlQGzj" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
