</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AF_zds0XML12ni2" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the years ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, there were no transfers between the fair value levels.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact001142" name="MGLD:DisclosureOfSaleOfBrigadierTextBlock"><p id="xdx_80B_ecustom--DisclosureOfSaleOfBrigadierTextBlock_zdzz8Oudkmnk" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>NOTE
7. <span id="xdx_82F_zZo51huoqlI7">SALE OF BRIGADIER</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">On</span>
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">June 17, 2025, the independent members of the Board of Directors
of the Company were presented with a proposed transaction for the sale of the Company&#8217;s wholly owned subsidiary, Brigadier Security
Systems (2000) Ltd., a Canadian registered corporation (&#8220;Brigadier&#8221;). The independent members of the Board of Directors reviewed
an independent valuation of the fair market value of Brigadier and based upon such valuation and their review of the terms of the proposed
transaction, approved the transaction.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
June 19, 2025, the Company <span style="background-color: white">entered into a stock purchase agreement (&#8220;Agreement&#8221;) with
SKCAL LLC,</span> an Arizona limited liability company (&#8220;SKCAL&#8221;), pursuant to which the Company agreed to sell to SKCAL all
of the shares of stock (&#8220;Shares&#8221;) that it owns in its wholly owned subsidiary, Brigadier. Scott Schoenberger, a director
and a <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20250619__srt--ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--DirectorMember_zUcqleJD6OW" title="Ownership percentage"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-19_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_srt_DirectorMember" id="Fact001144" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">10.9</ix:nonFraction></span>% shareholder of the Company, is the sole member of SKCAL. The closing (&#8220;Closing&#8221;) of the sale of Shares took place
on July 1, 2025 (&#8220;Closing Date&#8221;)<span style="background-color: white">.</span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Pursuant
to the Agreement, the purchase price for the Shares acquired by SKCAL at Closing was $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationConsideration_iI_pn5n6_c20250701__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_zedZHk42ePch" title="Purchase price of shares acquired"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationConsideration" contextRef="AsOf2025-07-01_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember" id="Fact001146" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million subject to certain adjustments thereto.
An initial payment of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses_pn5n6_c20250701__20250701__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--StockPurchaseAgreementsMember_zBv96Ts3h7ib"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses" contextRef="From2025-07-012025-07-01_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_custom_StockPurchaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001147" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million was paid within a few days of the execution and delivery of the Agreement by the parties. An additional
$<span id="xdx_90B_ecustom--AdditionalProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses_pn5n6_c20250630__20250630__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--StockPurchaseAgreementsMember_z5kNe7CzEC2l" title="Additional proceeds from divestiture of businesses"><ix:nonFraction name="MGLD:AdditionalProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses" contextRef="From2025-06-302025-06-30_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_custom_StockPurchaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001149" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million was paid near the Closing Date, of which $<span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinessesNetOfCashDivested_pn5n6_c20250630__20250630__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--StockPurchaseAgreementsMember_zV5Dzcz1TAOd" title="Proceeds from sale of shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinessesNetOfCashDivested" contextRef="From2025-06-302025-06-30_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_custom_StockPurchaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001151" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million was received as of June 30, 2025. A final payment of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinessesNetOfCashDivested_pn5n6_c20250901__20250901__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--StockPurchaseAgreementsMember_zaHJB7tS8jl3" title="Proceeds from sale of shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinessesNetOfCashDivested" contextRef="From2025-09-012025-09-01_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_custom_StockPurchaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001153" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.0</ix:nonFraction></span> million
was payable on September 1, 2025, subject to adjustment upward or downward thereto in the event of a difference between the Closing Date
schedule of Brigadier&#8217;s current assets and liabilities as of June 30, 2025 (&#8220;Target Balance Sheet&#8221;), and the schedule
of Brigadier&#8217;s audited current assets and liabilities as of June 30, 2025 (&#8220;Final Balance Sheet&#8221;), including adjustments
in the event accounts receivable become uncollectable, cash balances increase or decrease, and/or any liabilities arise prior to Closing
but which were not set forth on such Target Balance Sheet. After a comparison of the Final Balance Sheet and the Target Balance Sheet,
it was determined and agreed that an upwards adjustment of $<span id="xdx_906_ecustom--AdditionalProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses_pn5n6_c20250701__20260630__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--StockPurchaseAgreementsMember_zcpHvh9TWyV6" title="Additional proceeds from divestiture of businesses"><ix:nonFraction name="MGLD:AdditionalProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_custom_StockPurchaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001155" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.1</ix:nonFraction></span> million be added to the purchase price resulting in the final payment
amount being $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses_pn5n6_c20250701__20260630__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--StockPurchaseAgreementsMember_zCRzpX8BRyP6" title="Proceeds from sale"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_custom_StockPurchaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001157" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.1</ix:nonFraction></span> million.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">The
audit committee of the Company continued to have oversight of the transaction through the Closing Date of July 1, 2025, and the final
payment adjustment procedures concluding on September 1, 2025. While the Chief Operating Decision Maker evaluated the security systems
segment for operational purposes through June 30, 2025, this was not considered a significant operation to the Company during the years
ended June 30, 2025 and 2024, respectively. The Company received total proceeds of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses_pn5n6_c20240701__20250630__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--StockPurchaseAgreementsMember_zBWXpLTubmHa"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromDivestitureOfBusinesses" contextRef="From2024-07-012025-06-30_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_custom_StockPurchaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001158" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.3</ix:nonFraction></span></span>
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">million for the sale and had a cost
basis in Brigadier of $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--OtherAssets_iI_pn5n6_c20250630__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_znfqXwczpg3i"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherAssets" contextRef="AsOf2025-06-30_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember" id="Fact001159" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">1.7</ix:nonFraction></span></span>
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">million and thus recorded a gain on
the sale of Brigadier of $<span id="xdx_908_ecustom--GainLossOnSaleOfBusinessUnit_pn5n6_c20240701__20250630__us-gaap--IncomeStatementBalanceSheetAndAdditionalDisclosuresByDisposalGroupsIncludingDiscontinuedOperationsAxis__custom--BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--StockPurchaseAgreementsMember_zEV0re3ucLL8"><ix:nonFraction name="MGLD:GainLossOnSaleOfBusinessUnit" contextRef="From2024-07-012025-06-30_custom_BrigadierSecuritySystemsLtdMember_custom_StockPurchaseAgreementsMember" id="Fact001160" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.6</ix:nonFraction></span></span>
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: white">million.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


<ix:exclude><!-- Field: Page; Sequence: 44 -->
