<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The benefit from income taxes for the year ended
June 30, 2025, prior to the adoption of ASU 2023-09, differed from the amounts computed by applying the statutory federal income tax
rate of <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationAtFederalStatutoryIncomeTaxRate_pid_dp_uPure_c20240701__20250630_zoCybyyAK4Uj" title="Federal income tax rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationAtFederalStatutoryIncomeTaxRate" contextRef="From2024-07-012025-06-30" id="Fact001612" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">21.0</ix:nonFraction></span>% to pretax loss as a result of the following (in thousands):</p>

